    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Over 150 different Classic Card Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like solitaire, you're going to love this Classic Card Game Collection with over 150 different games, including popular classics such as Klondike, Spider, Freecell, Pyramid and many more, hours of enjoyment await you within this collection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn Lots of New Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marvel at this collection and enjoy playing all your favorite solitaire card games and discover new ones you've never seen before with rules to help you learn every single game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play for Fun and Show off Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete games and work your way to earning 3 stars in every game to show off your skills. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the look of your game to suit you with a wide range of card designs, card backs, backgrounds and even win animations. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features of Classic Card Games Collection</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 150+ different popular and original playing card games in a snap </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rules provided for each individual card game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization of appearance with hd backgrounds and cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth Functionality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlimited undo and redo </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Most Popular Solitaire Games Include</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addiction, Agnes Bernauer, Ali Baba, Algerian, Alaska, Alternation, American Toad, Arizona, Australian Patience, Baker's Dozen, Beehive, Big Harp, Blind Alleys, Block Ten, Blackjack 21s, <strong>Canfield</strong>, Castle, Chameleon, Cheops, Chessboard, Crescent, Cribbage, Demon Thieves, <strong>Eagle Wing</strong>, Easthaven, <strong>Eight Off</strong>, Elevens, Faerie Queen, Fall Star, Fan, Follow The King, <strong>Forty Thieves</strong>, <strong>FreeCell</strong>, Gaps, German Patience, Golf, Grand Clock, Heads and Tails, King's Corner, <strong>Klondike</strong>, Labyrinth, <strong>Pyramid</strong>, Scorpion, Seven Devils, <strong>Spider</strong>, Trefoil, <strong>Tri Peaks</strong>, Virginia Reel, Wasp, Yukon and so many more</p>",
